    "ImageDescription": {
      "value": "Malcolm Mitchell, left, New England Patriots’ wide receiver and Super Bowl LI Champion and Col. Thomas Kunkel, 23d Wing commander, pose for a photo during his visit March 7, 2017, at Moody Air Force Base, Ga. Mitchell, who is a Valdosta native, got a glimpse of a typical day in the life of some of Moody’s Airmen from the 23d Fighter Group, 23d Maintenance Group, 23d Mission Support Group, and the 820th Base Defense Group. During his visit, Mitchell also spent time with Airmen and signed autographs for local Patriots’ fans. (U.S. Air Force photo by Senior Airman Ceaira Young)",
